  "description": "<h3>Introduction</h3>\n<p>Fika sync for <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2431/fpv-drone-mod\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">FPV Drone Mod</a>. That’s about it. My first actual attempt at making Fika sync for any of my mods so it could be a bit jank here or there. This has to be installed by everyone playing. Should work fine with headless, let me know if it doesn’t!</p>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>First install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2431/fpv-drone-mod\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">FPV Drone Mod</a> and then just drag and drop.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" alt=\"wByb5Ln.gif\" /></a></p>\n<h3>Known Issues</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Explosions are sometimes not synced properly. Packets are arriving out of order?</li>\n<li>Dropping a drone before other players have loaded in will not sync them properly</li>\n</ul>\n",
